This product is an advanced unified decision engine synthesizing the best architectural
innovations from all major open-source Jev alternatives:
- NandhaKishorM/laya (Candidate shortlisting, text cleaning)
- cactus-compute/needle (Fast Walsh-Hadamard transform, grounding verification)
- theoleecj/semif (Single-token slot readouts, golden-section ECE calibration)
- jaredpalmer/kev (TypeSafe wire compatibility, date facts temporal arithmetic)
- wfzyx/von (100% order-invariant premise-option attention, 0.0% flip rate)
- TianyuCodings/NanoJev (Parallel multi-task batch evaluations)
- bespokelabsai/nimble (Candidate-only LM head projection, fitted temperature scaling)
- Rizzo-AI-Academy/rizzo-flow (Pure deterministic moment decoding, abstention guardrails)

